      "Text": "This update for mkvtoolnix fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in mkvtoolnix:\n\n- CVE-2026-90783: heap buffer overflow in the bundled avilib library's ODML superindex parser due to integer wraparound in 32-bit arithmetic (boo#1280126).\n",
